            <div xml:id="m-fa922042-ebb2-495a-9c64-17e6191cf524">
              <lg xml:id="m-817c4294-b005-43f9-9800-782eb65540ee">
                <l xml:id="m-2f4ceb64-2ca3-48c0-8a14-a6a96d6f0937" facs="#m-07779f3e-60a2-4e3e-aaa3-acebea1b8d8c" label="text-like">Ist Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-15d2debb-9639-46af-aa31-9696759bb50a" facs="#m-46d6f283-4811-42bc-a546-ed40614d9040" label="ambiguous">323</l><l xml:id="m-54521ae0-b0bf-4748-94f8-b47682d4efb7" facs="#m-46a69363-de01-4184-a4e4-805a9c123351" label="text-like">Against the persecutors of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-cae55f28-c4d2-4ef5-a592-bbba7fe5fa00" facs="#m-225e576a-6ce8-4d3d-81a0-f35639e68646" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, Dómine Deus noster:] patióne gaudére, humánis non sinas</l><l xml:id="m-969d0072-41a1-4559-975b-60d854b1b6a2" facs="#m-12189bf7-0a40-4e63-a4ff-e4f8a4713169" label="lyrics-like">Uut, quos divína tríbuis partici- subjacére periculis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e558335a-6847-4aab-8f1b-83fe8efc20e3" facs="#m-5fcab801-c40f-485c-acfd-1c85f14fbb58" label="text-like">Or</l><l xml:id="m-2da94ce5-fb6d-4de9-afff-3932c6505422" facs="#m-2230311a-984c-4f5c-bddc-39fa47c0c9f6" label="text-like">For the Pope.</l><l xml:id="m-1f408337-e424-48de-b98d-72a926c32fd0" facs="#m-31eed7dc-f46b-4a52-bf28-c05b3083b56c" label="lyrics-like">zAec nos, quaésumus Dómine,] ésse voluisti; una cum commísso sibi</l><l xml:id="m-ccf3e824-6209-4f78-afae-c37600f6f548" facs="#m-3fd06f9a-e9b4-4c0a-b8ca-19871d916b1c" label="lyrics-like">Lt divini sacraménti percéptio</l><l xml:id="m-85f2a710-ffc1-4dd2-bfed-4aea1073039c" facs="#m-3b2e9483-ac0c-4205-a3d9-bb5fe16cf503" label="lyrics-like">grege salvet semper, et múniat.</l><l xml:id="m-3fe60106-e56c-4e5d-baaf-23672711e651" facs="#m-9a990fe7-1836-46ff-8ee2-2f9e14cb4f2c" label="lyrics-like">prótegat: et fámulum tuum N.</l><l xml:id="m-cd8c15fb-fb6f-49a4-a5a8-d5c3ed9ec1f2" facs="#m-7c5faa5d-d0df-4ae7-a89a-d2d7452bf1a3" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-734cd34f-e47e-48d3-8377-fbea1f607ed6" facs="#m-568760ce-1842-4372-81cf-b5c76d9abe6f" label="lyrics-like">quem pastórem Ecclésiae tuae prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-0197be94-8cc4-43f1-8e4e-7a5e20513740" facs="#m-492ae21a-8966-47f5-913d-5703430c93bf" label="lyrics-like">At the end of Mass, the Priest says Benedicámus Dómino. which rule is</l><l xml:id="m-abb60094-4a8f-4502-a0a1-d0efa118ae86" facs="#m-40d26cbd-6cee-40fd-9818-02a497b8d2a7" label="lyrics-like">observed whenever the Glória in excélsis. is not said.</l><l xml:id="m-88d8883e-80d2-47b6-ac04-f869f688caca" facs="#m-3e05d113-14e8-4f67-823b-f2af06942d60" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-c28344ea-2071-4d2f-9171-42ecc9a17e14" facs="#m-9348d9db-d27d-4c83-b53d-23bfdb203975" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Ecce Dóminus véniet. 324.</l><l xml:id="m-7469d612-ec22-4aa0-a2d0-b3d3139a9ea9" facs="#m-62326848-a8f6-4cc0-86a2-441f3534fff9" label="ambiguous">Rom. 13. d.</l><l xml:id="m-148961ac-2071-442c-84cf-ee32d70e7a10" facs="#m-b6b279e9-0af1-4c79-83f5-b452fc99c6d2" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-5451ef4d-13b3-4aae-813b-afedf4960c5b" facs="#m-242b29b8-4ce3-431d-90ed-6c03be940b8a" label="lyrics-like">OX praecéssit, dies autem ap-] ergo ópera tenebrárum, “et induá¬</l><l xml:id="m-9204cbfe-fa83-4927-9d61-58928fc8552b" facs="#m-b8339282-9029-4207-9e71-2e302541caed" label="lyrics-like">Lt propinquávit: t abiiciámus ] mur arma lucis.</l><l xml:id="m-ac1ba149-a88b-46d5-bc97-0825f111de2e" facs="#m-ee475537-4129-4e5f-b372-83cfadd63b4f" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Osténde nóbis Dómine. 243. V. Meménto nóstri.</l><l xml:id="m-fd1c18ea-1a99-4f3c-a130-4ebf5a6c5e0d" facs="#m-d58bc615-6586-4968-8376-f114c1c234f4" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-a17f54aa-9453-42b8-90e0-2cfdd801c9b1" facs="#m-3dcfc75e-23b8-429e-8eee-be2f6b685ce8" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Ecce véniet. 324.</l><l xml:id="m-22b93de1-2ee5-4e4a-89df-39517cc8f4f8" facs="#m-48d0b4d2-5267-4f20-a968-d412f1058cfa" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-d4e6a26f-8ef6-4af9-959a-79d5b780f5d4" facs="#m-af93697f-750c-484d-94e6-9d3edccb501b" label="ambiguous">Rom. 13. d.</l><l xml:id="m-68d2d131-5f44-4afd-82ea-1e1164d82bb7" facs="#m-3e69b8f7-378c-443e-9328-10eb7f419dc4" label="lyrics-like">Qicut in die honéste ambulémus, dicitiis, non in contentióne et aemu¬</l><l xml:id="m-beefcf35-1d74-4c0a-936b-963210e19268" facs="#m-d7ef528f-02ff-4843-ad13-aef665113d66" label="lyrics-like">O non in comessatiónibus et ebrie-] latióne :* sed induimini Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-310fc24d-0569-4571-a79f-f4a719349fac" facs="#m-d834c060-8426-439f-a64c-44f3a8ae6ffa" label="lyrics-like">tátibus, t non in cubilibus et impu-l Jesum Christum.</l><l xml:id="m-6dcb5003-05e3-4fe0-9745-bde6f6ecf91d" facs="#m-4c241b63-e3bb-4924-b923-9b67a61ff9fd" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Super te Jerúsalem. 248. V. Véni Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-d06c1df6-f774-42c7-a4a0-9c822d64dca8" facs="#m-d6771a58-4dd3-4e0c-9df3-eda7f8b641b4" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-dd51a839-c287-42e8-9744-c9b8fbb4dffc" facs="#m-3c031c2c-d08e-44f1-8977-0130b6866a54" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Díxit Dóminus. 8. G. 133. — 2. Confitébor. 8. G*. 140. —</l><l xml:id="m-4915c8fd-876c-484e-b8ff-fd2f1c3a6e6c" facs="#m-576e8430-f7b2-4e1b-a2c2-9aa7c80022b2" label="lyrics-like">3. Beátus vir. S. a. 145 — 4. Laudáte púeri. 7. c. 151. — 5. In éxitu.</l><l xml:id="m-fe12b2e0-e4d5-46ce-bf59-e43c94e25c40" facs="#m-6e947f88-6b9b-4c08-a59c-c54810e8eac2" label="ambiguous">★ Ar. 155.</l><l xml:id="m-ab01d527-e9bf-4d42-a3a8-06bd3801ba98" facs="#m-575be169-7285-453f-8315-67680ac6aba9" label="ambiguous">1. Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-84fa8149-6f44-4d03-a762-041502b57af1" facs="#m-684b3a88-64c9-43e1-824b-4ddb612bdfc5" label="ambiguous">S.6</l><l xml:id="m-ad87e9e7-e04d-4143-b002-7a32721d4817" facs="#m-7a549c43-2d64-49de-84a1-ebb9bbb14c9c" label="ambiguous">I</l><l xml:id="m-2916dd87-387b-4f6c-8239-faf3d7a7006f" facs="#m-48032c49-9423-43a2-a2f6-f7a771f9f13d" label="lyrics-like">Nfl-la dí-e“ stillábunt móntes dulcédinem, et cól¬</l><l xml:id="m-efcc9af0-0f63-46ac-b1ed-0e2fc51dcacf" facs="#m-eaecc34d-a62a-44e3-8dcb-f7b5ea18d565" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-567c16e5-159d-4877-8b8c-2172dcccdb55" facs="#m-cf2da6b7-6603-4ecc-a252-585f39e04900" label="lyrics-like">les flû-ent lac et mel,</l><l xml:id="m-1c5056f6-7296-4e41-99d1-f01b79abd012" facs="#m-83c1ea57-f68d-4772-bf48-0b35bb1d9bdc" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-0c115c87-b238-4eaa-be25-2073c9a6a8dc" facs="#m-6d3cab60-9390-435f-9ffb-0ed84e4d8788" label="ambiguous">2.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-d40f9ecf-f35f-40d2-9eee-2bc9c240a574" facs="#m-1642bdcd-2cb2-4f03-94a1-becf6b522a30" label="ambiguous">8. G</l><l xml:id="m-07fa4ee1-c42d-4b96-aee9-7c6f726b9f65" facs="#m-9cbe4431-29e3-4261-878e-d086f86620f4" label="ambiguous">d</l><l xml:id="m-c9385cf5-2a3c-4eee-ba03-4425f5fff298" facs="#m-1154abeb-fead-426e-b7c4-b21990f9dd49" label="lyrics-like">Ucundá¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ede0392-24c4-471e-91df-950939b07e35" facs="#m-c18839eb-ca2f-4c5f-9aff-0d1ee8231f22" label="lyrics-like">fi-li-a Sí- on, exsúlta sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c067406-5a76-4ba3-bd9e-8f69784a4e4a" facs="#m-c6dcb451-6c84-4299-82e2-41174f9bed79" label="ambiguous">re</l></lg>
            </div>
